        BB,SL,B3MCP                  ! line  6
        L(BU,6),$X1+0.18             ! line  7  -LOAD BIT ADDRESS BITS
        BZRZ,B3ER1                   ! line  8  -IF NOT FULL WORD ADDR, ERROR
